<title>USA: Union Pacific Resources sues over patent.</title>
<headline>Union Pacific Resources sues over patent.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Pacific Resources Group Inc said Wednesday that it has filed a lawsuit against Chesapeake Energy Corp accusing it of infringing on a geosteering patent.</p>
<p>The lawsuit was filed through Union Pacific Resources's subsidiary, UPPC, against Chesapeake Energy's subsidiary, Chesapeake Operating Inc.</p>
<p>The company said the patent in question, geosteering technology, steers a drill bit while a well is drilling to keep the wellbore in a desired geological zone.</p>
</text>
